  "content": "\n\n<h1>Unique Dark</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Unique Dark 在 Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Unique Dark 在 CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality 在 Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"amongstreality 在 Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<p>此資源包為遊戲中每個功能方塊提供獨特的紋理。部分紋理需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a>。</p>\n<p>Unique Dark 支援眾多不同的模組，並且幾乎每次更新都會持續擴充。</p>\n<h2>Unique Dark - Lite 與 Full</h2>\n<p><strong>Unique Dark - Lite</strong> 是可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 下載的版本。</p>\n<p><strong>Unique Dark - Full</strong> 是可在我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 下載的版本。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>警告：</strong>此資源包僅能在上述平台下載，並在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-dark%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 擁有專屬頁面。如果你在任何其他平台上發現它，<strong>請勿下載</strong>，因為它們是未經官方授權私自重新發布的。下載連結可能導向惡意網站，且下載的內容可能含有病毒。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>以下列表顯示 Lite 和 Full 版本中包含的紋理，以及哪些需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能運作。未收錄於 Lite 版本的紋理也已重新繪製，以符合此資源包的藝術風格。</p>\n<h3>✅ 收錄於 Lite 版本：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>熔爐</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>銅箱</li>\n<li>預設潛影盒</li>\n<li>鐵砧</li>\n<li>鐵砧變體</li>\n<li>附魔台</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>村民職業變體</li>\n<li>可騎乘生物變體</li>\n<li>羊駝變體</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>✅ 收錄於 Full 版本（包含 Lite 版本的所有內容）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>高爐</li>\n<li>煙燻爐</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>銅箱變體</li>\n<li>彩色潛影盒</li>\n<li>煉藥鍋</li>\n<li>切石機</li>\n<li>砂輪</li>\n<li>製圖台</li>\n<li>鍛造台</li>\n<li>紡織機</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>合成器</li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚠️ 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>銅箱</li>\n<li>銅箱變體</li>\n<li>彩色潛影盒</li>\n<li>鐵砧變體</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>村民職業變體</li>\n<li>可騎乘生物變體</li>\n<li>羊駝變體</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>在此支持我和我的專案：</h2>\n<p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 訂閱紫水晶等級（Amethyst Tier）會員，即可取得 Unique Dark 的完整版本。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p>\n<h2>模組支援（目前已支援 80 個模組）</h2>\n<p>你可以透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 提出模組支援請求，我可能會在未來加入支援。目前已支援的模組如下：</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Accessories</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdvancedAE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 Import Export Card</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Enchanting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-spawners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Spawners</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2 Wireless Terminals</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Flux</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appliede\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppliedE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Hud</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faxiom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Axiom</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Backpacked</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-furnaces-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Furnaces Reforged</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbrewin-and-chewin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brewin' And Chewin'</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclientsort\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Client Sort</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafting Tweaks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feasy-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Shulker Boxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/li