blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moving Elevators</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refurbished-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod: Refurbished</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmusic-notification\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Music Notification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals Decorations</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-nether-chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Chested [Forge & Fabric]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-chat-reports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NoChatReports</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paladin's Furniture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/raised\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Raised</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252funiversal-sawmill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sawmill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShulkerBoxTooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-uncrafting-table-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Uncrafting Table</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Voice Chat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftoms-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage Mod</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TrashSlot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Useful Backpacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Notebook</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">yyz's backpack</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>連結</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>